        "text": "Anjana M.J. Hansen has served on the Cook County Circuit Court since 2014 and is the Deputy Presiding Judge in Skokie, handling felony cases. She was previously an Assistant Cook County State's Attorney, an Evanston contract attorney, and an Evanston alderman. In 2022, she sentenced a defendant to 23 years in prison for first-degree murder. In 2025, she denied a certificate of innocence in a wrongful conviction case.",
